u, I feel like its more important to maintain the discussion at hand, instead of derailing it any further.<br /> You seem strangely passionate about this, so if you - or anyone else - want to continue this particular discussion, I think its best if those people done so useing private messages or created a thread somewhere specifically to adress the topic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T20:35:17-07:00","id":590777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/570091-lgbtq-in-cofd-games?p=590595#post590595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As for what this has to do with the World of Darkness, this thread is a celebration of dipictions of Alternate Sexual Orinations and Alternate Genders, so I merely suggested that BDSM gets some representation. I didn't demand it they're entitled not to if they so chose, but I merely requested it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ignoring all of the off-topic stuff, there's the Whipping Boys Legacy in <b>Keys to the Supernal Tarot</b>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user